        # FUNCIÓN: Texto exacto: Ren'Py built-in translate blocks for dialogues + auto-export translate strings: for UI. Zero Python scripts during gameplay — pure native speed. Works for ~90% of games. Known limitation: Python {variable} texts and runtime-concatenated strings (quest text + "(?)" buttons) may not be captured. Switch to Standard if you see untranslated screen elements.
