"""The short list of games recently opened in LinguaNova.

LinguaNova deliberately starts without a selected game (the path is not
restored on start-up). The recent list keeps that rule: it is only offered
from a button next to the path field, nothing is selected automatically, and
the user can clear it. Only folders that really are Ren'Py games are added.
"""
