"""Installed languages, and the filter that keeps font folders out of them.

Older Font Injector versions stored fonts in ``tl/linguanova_fonts``. Ren'Py
takes every folder of ``tl/`` for a language, so the game's own language menu
would list "linguanova_fonts". The filter hides only those resource folders;
font files and paths stay as they are.
"""
