"""Install and remove game/zz_linguanova/, the part of LinguaNova a game loads.

The folder holds:

* ``linguanova.rpy``: fonts per language and the language choice in the game's
  own screens (see :mod:`src.core.delivery.script`);
* ``resource_filter.rpy``: keeps LinguaNova's font folders out of the language
  list (see :mod:`src.core.delivery.resources`).

Translations stay in ``game/tl/<language>/``, where Ren'Py expects them.
Nothing here defines labels or dialogue, so adding, rewriting or removing these
files never affects saved games. Their ``.rpyc`` are left alone: Ren'Py
recompiles a changed ``.rpy`` by itself.
"""
