# breaks export dedup. A single pass maps each escape exactly once.
# Implementación directa _unescape_rpy. Origen trazable: src/core/exporter.py.
# Secuencia del bloque: LN_src_core_exporter__re.sub → LN_src_core_exporter___RPY_ESCAPE_MAP.get → m.group.
