# INICIO: Acción de soporte render_runtime_hook_dynamic
# FUNCIÓN: Micro runtime hook for Native TLID mode — handles ONLY Python {variable} texts.
#
# Designed to coexist with auto-export translate strings: blocks:
# - Does NOT install say_menu_text_filter (no ZWS blocking)
