"""Pack the translations installed in a game into one ZIP or RAR file.

The package mirrors the game's own layout so another player can copy its
``game/`` folder over the same game version:

* everything under ``game/tl/`` (every language and sub-folder);
* the helper scripts LinguaNova writes next to them (language menu, runtime
  hook, font helpers, MOD scripts) and its font folders.

Nothing is translated here. The archive is built in a private temporary file,
re-read and checked against the hashes taken from disk, and only then moved
over the destination, so an interrupted run never leaves a half-written file.
"""
