"""Make screen texts of a game translatable, safely.

Replaces the old regex-based ``make_source_translatable``. Rules:

* A script is rewritten only when it decodes as UTF-8 (with or without BOM);
  the BOM and the line endings of the original are kept byte for byte.
* Before the first change, the untouched script is copied to
  ``<project>/linguanova_backup/source_original/`` (outside ``game/``, so
  Ren'Py never loads the copy). An existing copy is never overwritten.
* Every rewritten script is verified by :func:`wrapper.wrap_text`; if the
  verification fails, the file is not touched.
"""
