"""The MOD: an in-game panel with the game's money, time, inventory, mail and quests.

Replaces MOD Beta (``src/mod_beta``, removed in LinguaNova 1.5.0). It reads the
game while it runs instead of guessing from its scripts, opens inside the
game's own menu frame and is reached from the game's bottom button bar, its
Settings screen or a function key. See :mod:`.script`.
"""
