"""
External Translation Memory (TM) Module
========================================

Builds a translation memory from the tl/ folders of other Ren'Py projects.
The TM gives translations by exact match, without API calls,
while other games are translated.

Usage:
    1. Pick an external tl/<lang>/ folder on the Tools page
    2. Parse it with TLParser → extract original/translated pairs
    3. Save them as a JSON file in the tm/ folder
    4. Exact-match lookup during the pipeline translation

Storage: tm/<source_name>_<lang>.json
Format:
    {
        "meta": {
            "source_name": "GameA",
            "language": "turkish",
            "entry_count": 12430,
            "created": "2026-03-08T...",
            "source_path": "/path/to/game/tl/turkish"
        },
        "entries": {
            "Hello": "Merhaba",
            "Save": "Kaydet",
            ...
        }
    }
"""
