    '- Regression and engine validation details: docs/VERIFICACION_MULTIDIOMA.md.\n'
    '\n'
    '### 39. Automatic font-resource protection in every generation path — 2026-10-20\n'
    '\n'
    '- Version 1.1.2 generates and installs `zzz_linguanova_ocultar_fuentes.rpy`\n'
    '  automatically. The normal translator also installs it when optional menu\n'
    '  integration is disabled. The font utility installs it on its own, and the MOD\n'
    '  generator publishes it in the same transaction as its outputs.\n'
    '- The filter excludes only LinguaNova resource identifiers from automatic\n'
    '  language menus. It never renames, deletes or hides font files, changes legacy\n'
    '  paths, or disables Russian translation/font blocks.\n'
    '- Resource-filter writes are atomic and verified. A failed update retains the\n'
    '  previous file and bytecode; identical regeneration leaves bytecode intact.\n'
    '  Generated-script recognition excludes this helper from translation extraction.\n'
    '- The separate manual repair file and its copy instructions were removed from\n'
    '  the source package. Existing translated games can use the in-app language\n'
    '  integration utility without repeating the dialogue translation.\n'
    '- Regression tests cover automatic installation with menu on/off, legacy font\n'
    '  preservation, the independent font utility and MOD output, idempotence and\n'
    '  failed writes. SDK validation includes actual Cyrillic font loading.\n'
